    ["<Team_Target>[约战房间]</> %s"] = "<Team_Target> [Боевая комната] </> %s",
    ["<Yellow>放牧灵魂</>：穿戴者持续攻击主目标一段时间后，可将其灵魂剥离到自己脚下，<Yellow>10秒</>内触碰灵魂可将其吞噬，根据灵魂主人的类型，造成不同效果：\n吞噬非凡者的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并通过囚禁其灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂：\n    战士序列：<Yellow>黎明铠甲</>；\n    歌颂者序列：<Yellow>太阳誓约</>；\n    学徒序列：<Yellow>星云咏叹</>；\n    观众序列：<Yellow>心理暗示</>；\n    占卜家序列：<Yellow>诡秘之境</>；\n    窥秘人序列：<Yellow>星光囚笼</>；\n蠕动的饥饿提升危险等级时，对应技能强度随之提升。\n吞噬怪物的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并获得持续<Yellow>20</>秒的<Yellow>灵魂压制</>效果：buffdisc(*id)\n每20秒最多触发一次剥离灵魂效果，囚禁灵魂被释放之前，无法再次从其主人身上剥离灵魂。最多可同时囚禁<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</>个灵魂。"] = "<Yellow>Graze Soul</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows it to be devoured, causing different effects based on the soul owner's type: \nDevour Потусторонний soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them, and by imprisoning their soul, gain one corresponding Последовательность skill. Using this skill releases their soul: \n Warrior Последовательность: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n Bard Последовательность: <Yellow>Sun Oath</>; \n Apprentice Последовательность: <Yellow>Nebula Chant</>; \n Зритель Последовательность: <Yellow>Psychological Inculcation</>; \n Провидец Последовательность: <Yellow>Mystery Realm</>; \n Secrets Supplicant Последовательность: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \n When Creeping Hunger's danger level increases, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nDevour monster soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them and gains the <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect for <Yellow>20</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Before the imprisoned soul is released, another soul cannot be stripped from its owner. A maximum of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls can be imprisoned simultaneously.",
